  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</a><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> has released the notification for the post of Physiotherapist. This recruitment has been issued for 20 posts. The online application process for RPSC Physiotherapist Recruitment 2026 has started on 23 July 2026, and candidates can apply till 21 August 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for RPSC Physiotherapist Recruitment 2026, which are given below.</span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RPSC Physiotherapist Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RPSC Advt No 05/2026-27</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>23 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>21 August 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>21 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, Other State : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>600/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC, BC : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Charge : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Physiotherapist Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2027</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong><strong>1</strong>8 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RPSC Physiotherapist Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #0000ff; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Physiotherapist 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 20 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.8831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.8831%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"6\">Physiotherapist</td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">MBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">–</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RPSC Physiotherapist Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have passed Intermediate / 12th class examination from recognized Board and must have a Diploma in Physiotherapy recognized by Government of India. will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Working knowledge of Hindi written in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Physiotherapist Recruitment 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the RPSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other  Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for RPSC Physiotherapist recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC Physiotherapist Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" 